'''''Opuntia dejecta''''' is a species of plant in the [[cactus]] family. They are listed in [[CITES Appendix II|cites appendix ii]]. Flowers are visited by the [[broad-billed hummingbird]].<ref>{{Cite web|title=Nopalea dejecta (Salm-Dyck) Salm-Dyck - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/5177743|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Nopalea dejecta (Salm-Dyk) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/CACT/Nopalea_dejecta.php |access-date=2022-03-03 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us |archive-date=2021-12-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211227194613/https://www.maltawildplants.com/CACT/Nopalea_dejecta.php |url-status=dead }}</ref>

